+NEW_RUN='^(TestImportingUsersGroupsSecretScopes|TestImportingUser|TestImportingDLTPipelines|TestUserSearchFails|TestSpnSearchFails|TestSpnSearchSuccess|TestUserImportSkipNonDirectGroups|TestDataSourceGroup|TestDataServicePrincipalReadByAppId|TestDataServicePrincipalReadNotFound|TestDataServicePrincipalReadError|TestDataServicePrincipalsReadByDisplayName|TestDataServicePrincipalsReadNotFound|TestDataServicePrincipalsReadNoFilter|TestDataServicePrincipalsReadError|TestDataSourceUser|TestDataSourceUserGerUser|TestCreateForceOverwriteCannotListGroups|TestCreateForceOverwriteFindsAndSetsGroupID|TestCreateForceOverwriteCannotListServicePrincipals|TestCreateForceOverwriteCannotListAccServicePrincipals|TestCreateForceOverwriteFindsAndSetsServicePrincipalID|TestCreateForceOverwriteCannotListUsers|TestCreateForceOverwriteCannotListAccUsers|TestCreateForceOverwriteFindsAndSetsID|TestCreateForceOverwriteFindsAndSetsAccID|TestUsersFilter|TestUsersAPIListExcludesRolesWithoutFilter|TestUsersAPIFilterExcludesRolesAndPreservesFilter|TestServicePrincipalsAPIExcludesRolesForListAndFilter|TestGroupsAPIFilterIncludeRolesOption|TestGroupsAPIReadByDisplayNameReturnsFullGroupAfterLeanLookup)$'
